<title>USA: BW/IP names Rethore chairman.</title>
<headline>BW/IP names Rethore chairman.</headline>
<dateline>LONG BEACH, Calif. 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>BW/IP Inc, the parent company of BW/IP International Inc, said Monday it had named President and Chief Executive Officer Bernard Rethore to the additional post of chairman of the board.</p>
<p>Rethore succeeds Peter Valli, who had been chairman since BW/IP International was formed as a management-led buyout of the company from Borg-Warner Corp in 1987.</p>
</text>
